# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=ttf-dejavu
_lockname=dejavu-fonts
pkgver=2.37
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="DejaVu fonts: sans, serif and monospace, for many languages"
arch=(any)
url="https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/"
license=(Bitstream-Vera)
depends=(fontconfig)
install=ttf-dejavu.install
source=("https://github.com/dejavu-fonts/dejavu-fonts/releases/download/version_2_37/dejavu-fonts-ttf-$pkgver.tar.bz2")
sha256sums=('fa9ca4d13871dd122f61258a80d01751d603b4d3ee14095d65453b4e846e17d7')

package() {
    cd dejavu-fonts-ttf-$pkgver
    install -Dm644 -t "$pkgdir/usr/share/fonts/TTF" ttf/*.ttf
    install -Dm644 -t "$pkgdir/usr/share/fontconfig/conf.avail" fontconfig/*.conf
    install -d "$pkgdir/etc/fonts/conf.d"
    for conf in fontconfig/*.conf; do
        ln -s "/usr/share/fontconfig/conf.avail/${conf##*/}" "$pkgdir/etc/fonts/conf.d/${conf##*/}"
    done
    install -Dm644 LICENSE "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE"
}
